{%- comment -%}
  Cellexia — Treatment choice (Widgets A + B + E) for product templates.

  A: "Choose your treatment" — Continuous Treatment (dominant, pre-selected)
     vs Basic Purchase (muted). Savings % read from the product's selling
     plan group price adjustments. Optional third "Committed Treatment"
     card (enable_committed): best price in exchange for a minimum number
     of deliveries. Committed selling plans are identified by a
     case-insensitive name substring (committed_plan_match) since minCycles
     is not exposed to Liquid. committed_position 1 makes it the first card
     AND the pre-selected default; 2/3 slot it after the treatment / basic
     cards (treatment always stays before basic).
  B: Quantity pills 1/2/3 — selecting a quantity sets the delivery cadence
     automatically (block settings fallback 1→4 / 2→8 / 3→12 weeks,
     overridable by /apps/cellexia-subscriptions/api/widget-config cadenceDefaults).
     No frequency dropdown by default; an "advanced" toggle reveals it.
  E: Inline, dismissible, once-per-session comparison shown when Basic
     Purchase is selected. Never a modal; never obstructs add-to-cart.

  Styles: "choice" (default — plan vs basic chooser above), "max"
     ("Subscription Max": the Continuous Treatment plan is THE purchase
     path — one confident full-width card, pre-selected, no Basic Purchase
     card and no comparison framing. One-time purchase stays genuinely
     available, demoted to a quiet text link under add-to-cart; the Widget E
     nudge is suppressed unless enable_nudge_in_max) or "ultra"
     ("Subscription Max Ultra": the subscription is not presented as a
     concept AT ALL — no card, no heading, no plan name, no bullets, no
     ribbon and absolutely no savings framing (no compare price, no
     "Save X%"); the page reads like a completely normal purchase where the
     plan price simply IS the price. Ultra renders only: an optional
     minimal price line (show_price_line), the quantity pills
     (quantity_label — merchants set it to "Units"), the cadence and
     per-month lines (show_cadence_line / show_permonth_line), the advanced
     rhythm details, add-to-cart, and the quiet one-time link with NEUTRAL
     copy that never names the plan (locale cellexia.ultra.*, overridable
     via ultra_link_copy / ultra_link_back_copy). The one-time purchase
     stays genuinely selectable at its honest price — no competing
     presentation, no hiding. The Widget E nudge NEVER renders in ultra;
     the Committed Treatment card NEVER renders in ultra — cards are
     choice-framing, and ultra removes the choice architecture entirely,
     so committed plans also stay out of the advanced rhythm select).
     Resolved here for a zero-latency first paint: market_styles ("fr:max,
     us:ultra, de:choice", matched case-insensitively against
     localization.market.handle) overrides default_style; the widget-config
     API can still override per admin targeting (settings.style — the JS
     restyles the root after the fetch, and only when EXPLICITLY set).
     Purely visual: pricing and selling plans are identical between styles.

  First paint is 100% Liquid (zero-latency); cellexia-widgets.js hydrates,
  fetches enhancement config and posts telemetry through the app proxy.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if product -%}
  {%- assign cxw_product = product -%}
  {%- assign cxw_variant = cxw_product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
  {%- comment -%} Group selection: a product carries EVERY subscription app's
      selling plan groups (Joy, Recharge, ...). Never take the first blindly —
      prefer the group whose app_id matches ours (pushSellingPlanConfig writes
      appId "cellexia"), so another app's plans/discounts can't hijack the
      widget. Fallback to the first group only when no app_id matches (plan
      groups created before this marker existed — re-save the plan config in
      the Cellexia admin to stamp them). {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cxw_app_match = block.settings.plan_group_app_id | default: 'cellexia' | downcase -%}
  {%- assign cxw_group = nil -%}
  {%- for cxw_g in cxw_product.selling_plan_groups -%}
    {%- assign cxw_g_app = cxw_g.app_id | downcase -%}
    {%- if cxw_g_app contains cxw_app_match -%}
      {%- assign cxw_group = cxw_g -%}
      {%- break -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- unless cxw_group -%}
    {%- assign cxw_group = cxw_product.selling_plan_groups | first -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
  {%- assign cxw_has_plans = false -%}
  {%- if cxw_group.selling_plans.size > 0 -%}
    {%- assign cxw_has_plans = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- assign cxw_w1 = block.settings.cadence_qty1 | default: 4 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_w2 = block.settings.cadence_qty2 | default: 8 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_w3 = block.settings.cadence_qty3 | default: 12 -%}

  {%- comment -%} Widget style: market_styles ("fr:max, us:ultra, de:choice")
      wins over default_style for the visitor's market. Keys are market
      handles matched case-insensitively with spaces tolerated; missing
      localization.market (or no matching pair, or an unknown style value)
      leaves default_style in charge, and anything that is not exactly
      "max" or "ultra" collapses to "choice". {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cxw_style = block.settings.default_style | default: 'choice' -%}
  {%- assign cxw_market_handle = localization.market.handle | default: '' | downcase | strip -%}
  {%- if block.settings.market_styles != blank and cxw_market_handle != blank -%}
    {%- assign cxw_style_pairs = block.settings.market_styles | downcase | split: ',' -%}
    {%- for cxw_style_pair in cxw_style_pairs -%}
      {%- assign cxw_pair_kv = cxw_style_pair | split: ':' -%}
      {%- assign cxw_pair_market = cxw_pair_kv[0] | strip -%}
      {%- if cxw_pair_market == cxw_market_handle and cxw_pair_kv.size > 1 -%}
        {%- assign cxw_pair_style = cxw_pair_kv[1] | strip -%}
        {%- if cxw_pair_style == 'max' or cxw_pair_style == 'choice' or cxw_pair_style == 'ultra' -%}
          {%- assign cxw_style = cxw_pair_style -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- unless cxw_style == 'max' or cxw_style == 'ultra' -%}
    {%- assign cxw_style = 'choice' -%}
  {%- endunless -%}

  {%- comment -%} Committed Treatment card: find the committed plan pool by
      name substring, and its default plan (interval closest to the qty-1
      cadence — same rule as the standard default below and as the JS). The
      committed % setting is a DISPLAY fallback only; the real price always
      comes from the committed plan's allocation. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_on = false -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_pos = block.settings.committed_position | default: '2' -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_match = block.settings.committed_plan_match | default: 'commit' | downcase -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_pct = block.settings.committed_percent | default: 20 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_min = block.settings.committed_min_deliveries | default: 3 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_count = 0 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_plan_id = 0 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_best = 99999 -%}
  {%- if block.settings.enable_committed and cxw_has_plans -%}
    {%- for sp in cxw_group.selling_plans -%}
      {%- assign cxw_nm = sp.name | downcase -%}
      {%- if cxw_nm contains cxw_cm_match -%}
        {%- assign cxw_cm_count = cxw_cm_count | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- assign cxw_opt = sp.options.first.value | default: '' | downcase -%}
        {%- assign cxw_weeks = cxw_opt | plus: 0 -%}
        {%- if cxw_opt contains 'month' -%}
          {%- assign cxw_weeks = cxw_weeks | times: 4 -%}
        {%- elsif cxw_opt contains 'day' -%}
          {%- assign cxw_weeks = cxw_weeks | divided_by: 7.0 | round -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if cxw_weeks > 0 -%}
          {%- assign cxw_dist = cxw_weeks | minus: cxw_w1 | abs -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- assign cxw_dist = 9999 -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if cxw_dist < cxw_cm_best -%}
          {%- assign cxw_cm_best = cxw_dist -%}
          {%- assign cxw_cm_plan_id = sp.id -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if cxw_cm_count > 0 -%}
      {%- assign cxw_cm_on = true -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- comment -%} Committed is choice-framing: in ultra the card never
      renders and committed is never the pre-selected default. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_default = false -%}
  {%- if cxw_cm_on and cxw_cm_pos == '1' and cxw_style != 'ultra' -%}
    {%- assign cxw_cm_default = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_keep = 100 | minus: cxw_cm_pct -%}
  {%- assign cxw_cm_price = cxw_variant.price | times: cxw_cm_keep | divided_by: 100 -%}
  {%- for cxw_alloc in cxw_variant.selling_plan_allocations -%}
    {%- if cxw_alloc.selling_plan.id == cxw_cm_plan_id -%}
      {%- assign cxw_cm_price = cxw_alloc.price -%}
      {%- break -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Default plan = interval closest to the qty-1 cadence — the
      same rule the JS applies on hydration, so the first-paint price and
      savings never jump when the script boots. Mirrors the JS stdPool()
      split EXACTLY: committed-named plans stay out of the pick whenever the
      match text is set — the JS splits by data-committed-plan-match
      unconditionally, even with the committed card off. Pass 2 (only when
      every plan matched the name) reruns the scan without the name filter,
      replicating the JS fallback `standard.length ? standard : plans`.
      {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cxw_default_pct = 0 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_default_plan_id = 0 -%}
  {%- assign cxw_best_dist = 99999 -%}
  {%- if cxw_has_plans -%}
    {%- for cxw_pass in (1..2) -%}
      {%- if cxw_pass == 2 and cxw_default_plan_id != 0 -%}
        {%- break -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- for sp in cxw_group.selling_plans -%}
        {%- assign cxw_skip = false -%}
        {%- if cxw_pass == 1 and cxw_cm_match != blank -%}
          {%- assign cxw_nm = sp.name | downcase -%}
          {%- if cxw_nm contains cxw_cm_match -%}
            {%- assign cxw_skip = true -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- unless cxw_skip -%}
          {%- assign cxw_opt = sp.options.first.value | default: '' | downcase -%}
          {%- assign cxw_weeks = cxw_opt | plus: 0 -%}
          {%- if cxw_opt contains 'month' -%}
            {%- assign cxw_weeks = cxw_weeks | times: 4 -%}
          {%- elsif cxw_opt contains 'day' -%}
            {%- assign cxw_weeks = cxw_weeks | divided_by: 7.0 | round -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if cxw_weeks > 0 -%}
            {%- assign cxw_dist = cxw_weeks | minus: cxw_w1 | abs -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign cxw_dist = 9999 -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if cxw_dist < cxw_best_dist -%}
            {%- assign cxw_best_dist = cxw_dist -%}
            {%- assign cxw_default_plan_id = sp.id -%}
            {%- assign cxw_adj = sp.price_adjustments | first -%}
            {%- if cxw_adj and cxw_adj.value_type == 'percentage' -%}
              {%- assign cxw_default_pct = cxw_adj.value -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- assign cxw_default_pct = 0 -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} First-paint plan price: the default plan's allocation price
      for the selected variant (covers fixed_amount / price adjustment types),
      falling back to the percentage math. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign cxw_keep = 100 | minus: cxw_default_pct -%}
  {%- assign cxw_plan_price = cxw_variant.price | times: cxw_keep | divided_by: 100 -%}
  {%- for cxw_alloc in cxw_variant.selling_plan_allocations -%}
    {%- if cxw_alloc.selling_plan.id == cxw_default_plan_id -%}
      {%- assign cxw_plan_price = cxw_alloc.price -%}
      {%- break -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign cxw_display_pct = 0 -%}
  {%- if cxw_variant.price > 0 and cxw_plan_price < cxw_variant.price -%}
    {%- assign cxw_display_pct = cxw_variant.price | minus: cxw_plan_price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: cxw_variant.price | round -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  <div
    class="cxw cxw-choice cxw--{{ cxw_style }}"
    data-cxw-choice
    data-cxw-style="{{ cxw_style }}"
    data-market="{{ localization.market.handle }}"
    data-product-id="{{ cxw_product.id }}"
    data-selected-variant="{{ cxw_variant.id }}"
    data-requires-plan="{{ cxw_product.requires_selling_plan }}"
    data-money-format="{{ shop.money_format | escape }}"
    data-default-percent="{{ cxw_display_pct }}"
    data-cadence-defaults='{"1": {{ cxw_w1 }}, "2": {{ cxw_w2 }}, "3": {{ cxw_w3 }}}'
    {% if customer.b2b? %}data-b2b="true"{% endif %}
    data-enable-a="{{ block.settings.enable_widget_a }}"
    data-enable-b="{{ block.settings.enable_widget_b }}"
    data-enable-e="{{ block.settings.enable_widget_e }}"
    data-enable-nudge-in-max="{{ block.settings.enable_nudge_in_max }}"
    data-show-cadence-line="{{ block.settings.show_cadence_line }}"
    data-show-permonth-line="{{ block.settings.show_permonth_line }}"
    data-show-price-line="{{ block.settings.show_price_line }}"
    data-committed-enabled="{{ cxw_cm_on }}"
    data-committed-position="{{ cxw_cm_pos }}"
    data-committed-plan-match="{{ cxw_cm_match | escape }}"
    style="--cxw-ink: {{ block.settings.ink_color | default: '#1D1D1B' }}; --cxw-accent: {{ block.settings.accent_color | default: '#B1CDED' }}; --cxw-line: {{ block.settings.border_color | default: '#D8D8D8' }}; --cxw-band: {{ block.settings.band_color | default: '#F4F4F4' }};"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <script type="application/json" data-cxw-plans>
      [
        {%- if cxw_has_plans -%}
          {%- for sp in cxw_group.selling_plans -%}
            {%- assign cxw_adj = sp.price_adjustments | first -%}
            {"id": {{ sp.id | json }}, "name": {{ sp.name | json }}, "option": {{ sp.options.first.value | json }}, "valueType": {{ cxw_adj.value_type | json }}, "value": {{ cxw_adj.value | default: 0 | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      ]
    </script>
    {%- if cxw_cm_on -%}
      <script type="application/json" data-cxw-committed-plans>
        [
          {%- assign cxw_cm_first = true -%}
          {%- for sp in cxw_group.selling_plans -%}
            {%- assign cxw_nm = sp.name | downcase -%}
            {%- if cxw_nm contains cxw_cm_match -%}
              {%- unless cxw_cm_first -%},{%- endunless -%}{{ sp.id | json }}
              {%- assign cxw_cm_first = false -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        ]
      </script>
    {%- endif -%}
    <script type="application/json" data-cxw-variants>
      [
        {%- for v in cxw_product.variants -%}
          {"id": {{ v.id | json }}, "title": {{ v.title | json }}, "available": {{ v.available | json }}, "priceCents": {{ v.price | json }}, "compareAtCents": {{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 | json }}, "planPrices": {
            {%- for cxw_alloc in v.selling_plan_allocations -%}
              "{{ cxw_alloc.selling_plan.id }}": {{ cxw_alloc.price | json }}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          }}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ]
    </script>

    {%- comment -%} Ultra: no heading — a heading would present the plan as
        a concept to choose. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- unless cxw_style == 'ultra' -%}
      <h3 class="cxw-heading" data-cxw-heading>
        {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}{{ block.settings.heading }}{%- else -%}{{ 'cellexia.choice.heading' | t }}{%- endif -%}
      </h3>
    {%- endunless -%}

    {%- comment -%} ── Widget A: treatment choice cards (never for B2B —
        selling plans are bypassed for B2B at add-to-cart; never in ultra —
        cards are choice-framing, and that includes the committed card) ─── {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.settings.enable_widget_a and cxw_has_plans and customer.b2b? != true and cxw_style != 'ultra' -%}
      {%- comment -%} Committed card, captured once and slotted in by
          committed_position (1 = first + pre-selected default). {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- capture cxw_cm_card -%}
        <div
          class="cxw-card cxw-card--committed{% if cxw_cm_default %} is-selected{% endif %}"
          role="radio"
          aria-checked="{% if cxw_cm_default %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
          tabindex="{% if cxw_cm_default %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}"
          data-cxw-mode="committed"
        >
          <span class="cxw-card__title">{{ 'cellexia.choice.committed_title' | t }}</span>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="cxw-terms-btn"
            data-cxw-terms-toggle
            aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.a11y.committed_terms' | t }}"
            aria-describedby="cxw-terms-{{ block.id }}"
            aria-expanded="false"
          >?</button>
          <div class="cxw-tooltip" role="tooltip" id="cxw-terms-{{ block.id }}" hidden>
            {{- block.settings.committed_terms_full -}}
          </div>
          {% render 'cxw-price',
            price: cxw_cm_price,
            compare_at: cxw_variant.price,
            class: 'cxw-card__price',
            hook: 'cxw-committed-price',
            compare_hook: 'cxw-committed-compare'
          %}
          <span class="cxw-card__per">{{ 'cellexia.choice.per_delivery' | t }}</span>
          <ul class="cxw-card__bullets">
            <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.committed_bullet_best_price' | t }}</li>
            <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.committed_bullet_everything' | t }}</li>
            <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.committed_bullet_flexibility' | t: count: cxw_cm_min }}</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="cxw-card__terms" data-cxw-committed-terms hidden>{{ block.settings.committed_terms_short }}</p>
        </div>
      {%- endcapture -%}
      <div class="cxw-cards{% if cxw_cm_on %} cxw-cards--triple{% endif %}" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.a11y.choice_group' | t }}">
        {%- if cxw_cm_on and cxw_cm_pos == '1' -%}{{ cxw_cm_card }}{%- endif -%}
        <div
          class="cxw-card cxw-card--treatment{% unless cxw_cm_default %} is-selected{% endunless %}"
          role="radio"
          aria-checked="{% if cxw_cm_default %}false{% else %}true{% endif %}"
          tabindex="{% if cxw_cm_default %}-1{% else %}0{% endif %}"
          data-cxw-mode="treatment"
        >
          <span class="cxw-ribbon">{{ 'cellexia.choice.recommended' | t }}</span>
          <span class="cxw-card__title">{{ 'cellexia.choice.continuous_title' | t }}</span>
          {% render 'cxw-price',
            price: cxw_plan_price,
            compare_at: cxw_variant.price,
            class: 'cxw-card__price',
            hook: 'cxw-treatment-price',
            compare_hook: 'cxw-treatment-compare'
          %}
          <span class="cxw-card__per">{{ 'cellexia.choice.per_delivery' | t }}</span>
          <ul class="cxw-card__bullets">
            <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.continuous_bullet_improvement' | t }}</li>
            <li
              data-cxw-savings-copy
              data-cxw-savings-template="{{ 'cellexia.choice.continuous_bullet_save' | t: percent: '__PERCENT__' | escape }}"
            >
              {%- if cxw_display_pct > 0 -%}
                {{ 'cellexia.choice.continuous_bullet_save' | t: percent: cxw_display_pct }}
              {%- else -%}
                {{ block.settings.savings_copy }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </li>
            <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.continuous_bullet_flexibility' | t }}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        {%- if cxw_cm_on and cxw_cm_pos != '1' and cxw_cm_pos != '3' -%}{{ cxw_cm_card }}{%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} Max style: no Basic Purchase card at all — buying
            once lives in the quiet link under add-to-cart instead. {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- unless cxw_product.requires_selling_plan or cxw_style == 'max' -%}
          <div
            class="cxw-card cxw-card--basic"
            role="radio"
            aria-checked="false"
            tabindex="-1"
            data-cxw-mode="basic"
          >
            <span class="cxw-card__title">{{ 'cellexia.choice.basic_title' | t }}</span>
            {% render 'cxw-price',
              price: cxw_variant.price,
              class: 'cxw-card__price',
              hook: 'cxw-basic-price'
            %}
            <ul class="cxw-card__bullets cxw-card__bullets--muted">
              <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.basic_bullet_one_delivery' | t }}</li>
              <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.basic_bullet_standard_price' | t }}</li>
              <li>{{ 'cellexia.choice.basic_bullet_no_benefits' | t }}</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        {%- endunless -%}

        {%- if cxw_cm_on and cxw_cm_pos == '3' -%}{{ cxw_cm_card }}{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ── Ultra: minimal price line — the plan unit price, plain,
        no compare, no savings claim: in ultra the plan price simply IS the
        price. Rendered hidden in the other styles (like the quiet one-time
        link) so a widget-config restyle to ultra only has to unhide it. ── {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if cxw_has_plans and customer.b2b? != true -%}
      <p
        class="cxw-ultra-price"
        data-cxw-ultra-price
        {% unless cxw_style == 'ultra' and block.settings.show_price_line %}hidden{% endunless %}
      >{{ cxw_plan_price | money }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ── Widget E: inline comparison (hidden until Basic selected).
        Suppressed in the max style — a comparison box reintroduces the doubt
        that style removes — unless enable_nudge_in_max opts back in. NEVER
        rendered in ultra: there is no comparison to make when the
        subscription is not presented as a concept. ─────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign cxw_nudge_ok = true -%}
    {%- if cxw_style == 'max' and block.settings.enable_nudge_in_max != true -%}
      {%- assign cxw_nudge_ok = false -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if cxw_style == 'ultra' -%}
      {%- assign cxw_nudge_ok = false -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if block.settings.enable_widget_e and cxw_nudge_ok and cxw_has_plans and cxw_product.requires_selling_plan == false and customer.b2b? != true -%}
      <div
        class="cxw-nudge"
        data-cxw-nudge
        data-cxw-annual-template="{{ 'cellexia.nudge.annual_saving' | t: amount: '__AMOUNT__' | escape }}"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="cxw-nudge__band" role="note">
          <button type="button" class="cxw-nudge__close" data-cxw-nudge-dismiss aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.nudge.dismiss' | t }}">&times;</button>
          <p class="cxw-nudge__title">{{ 'cellexia.nudge.title' | t }}</p>
          <div class="cxw-nudge__compare">
            <div class="cxw-nudge__col">
              <span class="cxw-nudge__label">{{ 'cellexia.nudge.basic_price_label' | t }}</span>
              <span class="cxw-nudge__value" data-cxw-nudge-basic>{{ cxw_variant.price | money }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cxw-nudge__col">
              <span class="cxw-nudge__label">{{ 'cellexia.nudge.treatment_price_label' | t }}</span>
              <span class="cxw-nudge__value" data-cxw-nudge-plan>{{ cxw_plan_price | money }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="cxw-nudge__saving" data-cxw-nudge-annual></p>
          <p class="cxw-nudge__line">{{ 'cellexia.nudge.continuity' | t }}</p>
          <p class="cxw-nudge__line">{{ 'cellexia.nudge.flexibility' | t }}</p>
          <button type="button" class="cxw-linkbtn" data-cxw-nudge-switch>{{ 'cellexia.nudge.switch' | t }}</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ── Own variant selector (hidden by JS when the theme's
        [sm-rc-variant-selector] is present on the page) ────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if cxw_product.variants.size > 1 -%}
      <div class="cxw-variant" data-cxw-variant-wrap>
        <label class="cxw-label" for="cxw-variant-{{ block.id }}">{{ 'cellexia.a11y.variant_label' | t }}</label>
        <select id="cxw-variant-{{ block.id }}" class="cxw-select" data-cxw-variant-select>
          {%- for v in cxw_product.variants -%}
            <option
              value="{{ v.id }}"
              {% if v.id == cxw_variant.id %}selected{% endif %}
              {% unless v.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
            >
              {{ v.title }}
            </option>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </select>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ── Widget B: quantity → cadence ─────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if block.settings.enable_widget_b and cxw_has_plans -%}
      <div class="cxw-qty" data-cxw-qty-widget>
        {%- comment -%} quantity_label applies in EVERY style — for ultra,
            merchants set it to "Units" ("per delivery" pre-frames the
            cadence before the shopper reaches it). {%- endcomment -%}
        <span class="cxw-label" id="cxw-qty-label-{{ block.id }}">
          {%- if block.settings.quantity_label != blank -%}{{ block.settings.quantity_label }}{%- else -%}{{ 'cellexia.cadence.quantity_label' | t }}{%- endif -%}
        </span>
        <div class="cxw-pills" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="cxw-qty-label-{{ block.id }}">
          <button type="button" class="cxw-pill is-selected" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" data-cxw-qty="1" aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.cadence.one_unit' | t }}">1</button>
          <button type="button" class="cxw-pill" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-cxw-qty="2" aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.cadence.many_units' | t: count: 2 }}">2</button>
          <button type="button" class="cxw-pill" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-cxw-qty="3" aria-label="{{ 'cellexia.cadence.many_units' | t: count: 3 }}">3</button>
        </div>
        {%- comment -%} Cadence and per-month lines are individually
            toggleable in ALL styles (show_cadence_line / show_permonth_line
            — the JS honors the matching data-show-* root attrs too). {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if block.settings.show_cadence_line -%}
          <p
            class="cxw-cadence"
            data-cxw-cadence
            data-cxw-cadence-template="{{ 'cellexia.cadence.delivered_every' | t: weeks: '__WEEKS__' | escape }}"
            data-cxw-cadence-committed-template="{{ 'cellexia.cadence.delivered_every_committed' | t: weeks: '__WEEKS__', min: cxw_cm_min | escape }}"
            aria-live="polite"
          >
            {{ 'cellexia.cadence.delivered_every' | t: weeks: cxw_w1 }}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if block.settings.show_permonth_line -%}
          <p
            class="cxw-permonth"
            data-cxw-permonth
            data-cxw-permonth-template="{{ 'cellexia.cadence.about_monthly' | t: monthly: '__MONTHLY__' | escape }}"
            data-cxw-permonth-multi-template="{{ 'cellexia.cadence.multi_breakdown' | t: qty: '__QTY__', unit: '__UNIT__', monthly: '__MONTHLY__' | escape }}"
            aria-live="polite"
            hidden
          ></p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if cxw_group.selling_plans.size > 1 -%}
          <details class="cxw-advanced" data-cxw-advanced>
            <summary class="cxw-advanced__toggle">{{ 'cellexia.cadence.advanced_toggle' | t }}</summary>
            <label class="cxw-label" for="cxw-plan-{{ block.id }}">{{ 'cellexia.cadence.plan_label' | t }}</label>
            <select id="cxw-plan-{{ block.id }}" class="cxw-select" data-cxw-plan-select>
              {%- comment -%} Ultra: committed plans stay out of the rhythm
                  select — committed is choice-framing and its terms
                  disclosure lives on the (never-rendered) card. {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- for sp in cxw_group.selling_plans -%}
                {%- assign cxw_sp_skip = false -%}
                {%- if cxw_style == 'ultra' and cxw_cm_match != blank -%}
                  {%- assign cxw_sp_nm = sp.name | downcase -%}
                  {%- if cxw_sp_nm contains cxw_cm_match -%}
                    {%- assign cxw_sp_skip = true -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- unless cxw_sp_skip -%}
                  <option value="{{ sp.id }}">{{ sp.name }}</option>
                {%- endunless -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </select>
          </details>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ── Add to cart (theme .btn/.btn--primary parity) ─────── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="cxw-atc-row">
      <button
        type="button"
        class="cxw-btn cxw-btn--primary cxw-atc"
        data-cxw-atc
        data-label-add="{{ 'cellexia.atc.add' | t | escape }}"
        data-label-adding="{{ 'cellexia.atc.adding' | t | escape }}"
        data-label-added="{{ 'cellexia.atc.added' | t | escape }}"
        data-label-oos="{{ 'cellexia.atc.oos' | t | escape }}"
        {% unless cxw_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
      >
        <span data-cxw-atc-label>
          {%- if cxw_variant.available -%}{{ 'cellexia.atc.add' | t }}{%- else -%}{{ 'cellexia.atc.oos' | t }}{%- endif -%}
        </span>
        <span class="cxw-atc__price" data-cxw-atc-price>
          {%- if cxw_has_plans and customer.b2b? != true -%}
            {%- if cxw_cm_default -%}{{ cxw_cm_price | money }}{%- else -%}{{ cxw_plan_price | money }}{%- endif -%}
          {%- else -%}{{ cxw_variant.price | money }}{%- endif -%}
        </span>
      </button>
      {%- comment -%} The demoted one-time purchase (max + ultra styles): a
          quiet, honest text link — never a card. Rendered (hidden) in the
          choice style too, so a widget-config style override can restyle
          the root to max/ultra without injecting markup;
          requires_selling_plan products never render it (nothing to buy
          once). Liquid fills the first-paint price; the JS swaps the
          __PRICE__ templates as the mode toggles. BOTH template sets are
          stamped: the max copy names Continuous Treatment, the ultra copy
          is NEUTRAL (never names a plan — in ultra there is no plan concept
          to reference). Merchant overrides (ultra_link_copy /
          ultra_link_back_copy) use {price} for the one-time price; blank
          falls back to the cellexia.ultra.* locale defaults. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if cxw_has_plans and cxw_product.requires_selling_plan != true and customer.b2b? != true -%}
        {%- assign cxw_once_price = cxw_variant.price | money -%}
        {%- assign cxw_price_placeholder = '{price}' -%}
        {%- capture cxw_ultra_link_tpl -%}
          {%- if block.settings.ultra_link_copy != blank -%}{{ block.settings.ultra_link_copy | replace: cxw_price_placeholder, '__PRICE__' }}{%- else -%}{{ 'cellexia.ultra.basic_link' | t: price: '__PRICE__' }}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endcapture -%}
        {%- capture cxw_ultra_back_tpl -%}
          {%- if block.settings.ultra_link_back_copy != blank -%}{{ block.settings.ultra_link_back_copy | replace: cxw_price_placeholder, '__PRICE__' }}{%- else -%}{{ 'cellexia.ultra.basic_back' | t: price: '__PRICE__' }}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endcapture -%}
        <button
          type="button"
          class="cxw-basic-link"
          data-cxw-basic-link
          aria-pressed="false"
          data-cxw-basic-link-template="{{ 'cellexia.max.basic_link' | t: price: '__PRICE__' | escape }}"
          data-cxw-basic-back-template="{{ 'cellexia.max.basic_back' | t: price: '__PRICE__' | escape }}"
          data-cxw-ultra-link-template="{{ cxw_ultra_link_tpl | escape }}"
          data-cxw-ultra-back-template="{{ cxw_ultra_back_tpl | escape }}"
          {% unless cxw_style == 'max' or cxw_style == 'ultra' %}hidden{% endunless %}
        >
          {%- if cxw_style == 'ultra' -%}
            {{- cxw_ultra_link_tpl | replace: '__PRICE__', cxw_once_price -}}
          {%- else -%}
            {{- 'cellexia.max.basic_link' | t: price: cxw_once_price -}}
          {%- endif -%}
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}
      <p
        class="cxw-assurance"
        data-cxw-assurance
        data-cxw-assurance-default="{{ 'cellexia.choice.continuous_bullet_flexibility' | t | escape }}"
        data-cxw-assurance-committed="{{ 'cellexia.atc.assurance_committed' | t: min: cxw_cm_min | escape }}"
      >{{ 'cellexia.choice.continuous_bullet_flexibility' | t }}</p>
      <p class="cxw-error" data-cxw-error role="alert" hidden>{{ 'cellexia.atc.error' | t }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="cxw cxw-editor-note">Add this block to a product template to show the Cellexia treatment choice.</div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Treatment choice",
  "target": "section",
  "javascript": "cellexia-widgets.js",
  "stylesheet": "cellexia-widgets.css",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Style" },
    { "type": "select", "id": "default_style", "label": "Widget style", "options": [ { "value": "choice", "label": "Choice — plan and basic purchase cards" }, { "value": "max", "label": "Subscription Max — one confident plan card" }, { "value": "ultra", "label": "Subscription Max Ultra — plan price is the price" } ], "default": "choice", "info": "Subscription Max shows the Continuous Treatment plan as the purchase path: no Basic Purchase card, buying once becomes a quiet text link under add-to-cart. Subscription Max Ultra removes the subscription framing entirely: no card, no heading, no plan name, no savings claims — just the price, the quantity pills and the delivery lines; the comparison nudge and the Committed Treatment card never render. Tip: set the Quantity label to \"Units\" for Ultra." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "market_styles", "label": "Style per market", "info": "market-handle:style pairs, e.g. fr:max, us:ultra, de:choice — overrides the default for those markets." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_nudge_in_max", "label": "Show the comparison nudge in Subscription Max", "default": false, "info": "Off by default — the Max style avoids comparison framing on purpose. Never applies to Subscription Max Ultra." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_price_line", "label": "Show the price line (Ultra)", "default": true, "info": "Subscription Max Ultra only: a minimal plan-price line where the cards would be — plain, no compare price, no savings claim." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ultra_link_copy", "label": "Ultra one-time link", "info": "Subscription Max Ultra only — neutral copy, never names the plan. Use {price} for the one-time price. Blank = \"Prefer a single delivery? Buy once for {price}\"." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ultra_link_back_copy", "label": "Ultra one-time link — selected state", "info": "Shown after switching to buy-once. Use {price}. Blank = \"Buying once at {price} — switch back\"." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Widgets" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_widget_a", "label": "Show treatment choice cards (Widget A)", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_widget_b", "label": "Show quantity and delivery rhythm (Widget B)", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_cadence_line", "label": "Show the delivery cadence line", "default": true, "info": "The \"Delivered every N weeks\" line under the quantity pills (all styles)." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_permonth_line", "label": "Show the per-month cost line", "default": true, "info": "The \"About X a month\" line under the cadence (all styles)." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_widget_e", "label": "Show gentle comparison when Basic Purchase is selected (Widget E)", "default": true, "info": "Never renders in Subscription Max Ultra." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Committed Treatment card" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_committed", "label": "Show the Committed Treatment card", "default": false, "info": "Needs committed selling plans in the product's plan group whose names contain the match text below." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "committed_position", "label": "Card position", "options": [ { "value": "1", "label": "First (pre-selected default)" }, { "value": "2", "label": "Second" }, { "value": "3", "label": "Third" } ], "default": "2" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "committed_percent", "label": "Committed discount %", "default": 20, "info": "Display fallback only — the price always comes from the committed selling plan." },
    { "type": "number", "id": "committed_min_deliveries", "label": "Minimum deliveries", "default": 3 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "committed_terms_short", "label": "Terms line (inside the card)", "default": "Commit to at least 3 deliveries and get 20% off" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "committed_terms_full", "label": "Full terms (tooltip)", "default": "The Committed Treatment Plan gives you our best price in exchange for your first 3 deliveries arriving as scheduled. During the commitment your delivery schedule stays fixed — pausing, delaying, skipping and cancelling unlock after your 3rd delivery. From then on, full flexibility: adjust, delay or cancel online." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "committed_plan_match", "label": "Committed plan name match", "default": "commit", "info": "Case-insensitive name substring that identifies committed selling plans." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "plan_group_app_id", "label": "Selling plan group app ID", "default": "cellexia", "info": "Only the selling plan group whose app_id contains this renders here — keeps other subscription apps' plans (Joy, Recharge, …) out of the widget. Matches the appId Cellexia writes when you save a plan configuration." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Copy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "info": "Leave blank to use the translated default (\"Choose your treatment\"). Never shown in Subscription Max Ultra." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "quantity_label", "label": "Quantity label", "default": "Units per delivery", "info": "Label above the quantity pills, in every style — set it to \"Units\" for Subscription Max Ultra." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "savings_copy", "label": "Savings bullet fallback", "default": "Preferred pricing on every delivery", "info": "Shown when the selling plan has no percentage discount." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Delivery rhythm defaults (weeks)" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cadence_qty1", "label": "1 unit — deliver every", "min": 1, "max": 24, "step": 1, "unit": "wk", "default": 4 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cadence_qty2", "label": "2 units — deliver every", "min": 1, "max": 24, "step": 1, "unit": "wk", "default": 8 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cadence_qty3", "label": "3 units — deliver every", "min": 1, "max": 24, "step": 1, "unit": "wk", "default": 12 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colors" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "ink_color", "label": "Ink", "default": "#1D1D1B" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "accent_color", "label": "Accent", "default": "#B1CDED" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "border_color", "label": "Borders", "default": "#D8D8D8" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "band_color", "label": "Band background", "default": "#F4F4F4" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
